      "body": "  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 198, in _run_module_as_main\n  File \"<frozen runpy>\", line 88, in _run_code\n  File \"/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/solar_event/3_finetune_template_1D.py\", line 274, in <module>\n    main()\n  File \"/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/solar_event/3_finetune_template_1D.py\", line 260, in main\n    lit_model = build_model(cfg, scalers, train_baseline=args.train_baseline)\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/solar_event/3_finetune_template_1D.py\", line 126, in build_model\n    train_loss : SolarEventMetrics(\"train_loss\"),\n    ^^^^^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'train_loss' is not defined\n\nWhat is with this error?",
