      "id": "213b87ca-1ced-4f85-868d-0e7dbb92aac0",
      "body": "Confirmed \u2014 `SolarEventLightningModule` does exact-key lookups: `metrics[\"train_loss\"]`, `metrics[\"val_loss\"]`, `metrics[\"train_metrics\"]`, `metrics[\"val_metrics\"]`. My fix uses exactly those keys, so it'll work now. Try running it again.",
