      "body": "yeah, its working.\n\nMoving forward, these are the things I would love to work with.\n1. Runs with different amounts of training data and the same validation.\n2. Runs with different training sets and the same validation (build your own ensemble).\n3. Baseline and finetuning runs with identical training and validation sets.\nWhat do I need to do to make these changes?",
