      "body": "[CKPT] Best checkpoint: /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/checkpoints/best-epoch=18-val_loss=0.6656.ckpt\n[CKPT] Best val_loss: 0.665639\n\nIs this actually good enough, since it is mostly binary, should I bias it to take more 1s?",
