            "raw_output": "(2922, 5)\n['Start_Date', 'End_Date', 'Start_DOY', 'Solar_Event_Occurrence', 'Time_scale']\nSolar_Event_Occurrence\n0    0.625599\n1    0.374401\nName: proportion, dtype: float64\nSolar_Event_Occurrence\n0    1828\n1    1094\nName: count, dtype: int64",
